  "title": "cmux.widget.tokens/1",
  "description": "The theme token set that the host gives every widget: hostContext.styles.variables in ui/initialize and in each ui/notifications/host-context-changed (always the full set). The names are the MCP Apps standard style variables plus cmux additions (prefix --cmux-). The host builds the values from the Ghostty terminal theme for the current scheme; it sends resolved values, never light-dark(). No value may contain a parenthesis, a semicolon, a brace, a backslash or a URL, so a token cannot load anything. Within version 1, names are only added, never removed or renamed. T1 renderers read the same variables in the pane.",
